Type: Package
Package: climr
Title: Analyse and Plot the Latest Global and Hemispheric Climate Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Keefe", "Murphy", , "keefe.murphy@mu.ie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Keefe Murphy (keefe.murphy@mu.ie)
Description: Downloads the latest climate data from NASA at monthly,
    quarterly, and yearly intervals. Performs basic modelling of said data
    and creates nice plots of temperature anomalies over time.
License: GPL (>= 3)
BugReports: https://github.com/Keefe-Murphy/climr/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    readr,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    viridis
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
